The "abc" digest (Appendix B) and the self-test grand hash (Appendix E) in rfc7693.txt are copied
from RFC 7693 (https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7693.txt). test/driver.om translates the
Appendix E self-test procedure (selftest_seq, the md_len and in_len tables, blake2s_res) into
Omega. Its notice, verbatim:

